<title>INDIA: India GESCO unit gets ISO certification.</title>
<headline>India GESCO unit gets ISO certification.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Great Eastern Shipping Company Ltd (GESCO) said its offshore division was awarded ISO 9002 certification by Det Norske Veritas (DNV) of Norway.</p>
<p>&quot;We have the distinction of being the first Indian company owning and operating offshore vessels to be awarded this certificate,&quot; Capt D.H. Sidhva, deputy general manager (safety), said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>GESCO is India's leading private shipping company.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
